softfloat provides the CMake target:

    find_package(softfloat CONFIG REQUIRED)

    target_link_libraries(
        your_target
        PRIVATE
            softfloat::softfloat
    )

The public C API can be included as:

    #include <softfloat/softfloat.h>

Linking the target supplies its required public compile definitions; do not define SoftFloat configuration macros manually.
